references:
  - type: dataset
    title: "MaleCNS v1.0 — male Drosophila brain connectome (full adult central nervous system)"
    year: 2026
    month: 9
    publisher:
      name: "Janelia Research Campus / FlyEM"
    license: "CC-BY"
    url: "https://male-cns.janelia.org/download"
    notes: >-
      Obtained from the public object store gs://flyem-male-cns/v1.0/ and
      queryable via neuPrint dataset male-cns:v1.0. Published in Cell,
      2026-09-03. 166,700 neurons / 124,177,617 synapses / 11,691 cell types.
      The 5.63 GB dataset is NOT redistributed in this repository.
  - type: software
    title: "dataprov — W3C PROV document generation (zero-dependency)"
    authors:
      - name: "RI-SE"
    url: "https://github.com/RI-SE/dataprov"
    notes: "Used to serialize motif provenance as W3C PROV-JSON (schema v1.2.1)."
  - type: article
    title: "The free-energy principle: a rough guide to the brain?"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Friston"
        given-names: "Karl"
    year: 2008
    journal: "Neuropsychologia"
    notes: >-
      Together with Fodor (1983) The Modularity of Mind, frames the
      massive-modularity debate the fault-isolation claim sits within.
